WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.818 --> 00:00:07.388
Welcome to the District Admin portal. In this tour you'll see what's here and where to find it, in about two minutes.

2
00:00:07.889 --> 00:00:20.149
The menu on the left has four pages: Dashboard, Branding, Schools, and Portrait of a Graduate. At the bottom are the Help center, Help videos, a link to view the site, and Log Out.

3
00:00:20.649 --> 00:00:27.919
If you administer more than one district, a district picker appears at the top of the menu. Choose a district there to switch.

4
00:00:28.421 --> 00:00:34.451
The block at the bottom of the menu shows your district and your name, so you always know which account you're in.

5
00:00:34.952 --> 00:00:46.282
A banner appears across the top when any school in your district has a license that has expired, or will expire within thirty days. It links to the Schools page, so you can see which one.

6
00:00:46.783 --> 00:01:02.933
The dashboard shows how your district is doing: how many schools you have, how many seats are in use, and how many teachers are active. Below that is a short list of anything that needs your attention, a table of your schools, and a summary of your Portrait of a Graduate.

7
00:01:03.433 --> 00:01:07.933
Branding sets the default logo and colors for the schools in your district.

8
00:01:08.436 --> 00:01:15.016
Schools lists every licensed school and its administrators, and it's where you invite school administrators.

9
00:01:15.516 --> 00:01:21.866
Portrait of a Graduate is where you record your district's own graduate profile and send it to us for review.

10
00:01:22.368 --> 00:01:30.318
Each of those has its own video. You can find them from the Help videos link, or from the how-to video button in the corner of the page.
